# Photo mode away from home: in the Forum the photo bar opens, the caption names the world and
# a postcard is saved to its folder; Esc closes the bar and the place's interface returns.
set world forum 1
wait 30
expect away yes
key p
wait 10
expect photo on
key space
wait 10
expect postcards 1
shot shots/photo_away.png
key escape
wait 10
expect photo off
expect widget map yes
quit
